OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FThe morning will be dry, cloudy
OL,6,Fin the south with the best of the
OL,7,Fbrightness in the north. Cloud will
OL,8,Fspread north in the afternoon, leaving
OL,9,Fsunny spells over the Moray Coast.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA mostly dry evening and
OL,12,Fnight with clear spells at times but
OL,13,Fcloudy with the chance of an odd
OL,14,Fevening shower in the south.
OL,15,
OL,16,CFriday:FThe day will continue dry with
OL,17,Fbright or sunny spells increasing into
OL,18,Fthe afternoon. Cloud will spread east
OL,19,Ftowards the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
