OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry with sunny spells then patchy rain
OL,7,Fspreading south Saturday afternoon.
OL,8,FSunday and Monday will continue mostly
OL,9,Fdry with bright or sunny spells.
